# Changelog

Maintain root `CHANGELOG.md` in [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) form, versions following [SemVer](https://semver.org/). Newest section first.

## When to update

In the **same change** as the code, add a bullet under `[Unreleased]` when the work:

- Fixes rendering, import, tessellation, transforms, or viewport behavior
- Adds or changes a user-facing command, UI, or `--import-only` output
- Changes a public crate API or the workspace version in `Cargo.toml`

Do **not** log formatting-only edits, comment-only edits, or plan/rule files.

Do **not** bump `workspace.package.version` unless the user asked for a release. Unreleased work stays under `[Unreleased]`.

## How to write entries

- Start with a verb: `Fix`, `Add`, `Change`, `Remove`
- Say **why it matters**, not the file list
- Group under `### Added`, `### Changed`, `### Fixed`, or `### Removed`
- Name DWG/entity types in caps (`LWPOLYLINE`, `INSERT`, bulge, OCS)

```markdown
### Fixed
- Correct LWPOLYLINE bulge sign so positive bulge is CCW in world XY.
```

When the user asks to release, move `[Unreleased]` items into `## [X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD`, match `Cargo.toml`, and leave an empty `[Unreleased]` section on top.
